This software was built for Smart India Hackathon 2026, problem statement SIH26126.

The mission parser's models are fine-tuned from two pre-trained models:
  - TinyBERT General 4L-312D, Huawei Noah's Ark Lab (huawei-noah/TinyBERT_General_4L_312D)
  - BERT-Tiny, Google Research (google/bert_uncased_L-2_H-128_A-2)
parser/models/*/vocab.txt is the BERT uncased WordPiece vocabulary from Google Research.
